  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Learning Visit to Ethopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Having resilience enshrined in all our programs contributes towards a just world. Resilience requires that we move beyond thematic programs and consider people, the environment and the systems in which we co-exist. CAFOD Ethiopia and their strategic partnerships with organisations such as Trocaire and SCIAF stand out in the areas of Resilience and sustainability integration within their programs. In this regards, CAFOD Liberia and sierra Leone program staff and implementing partners will embark on a one week learning visit to Ethiopia for exchange of ideas on resilience integration and interventions for our own application in Liberia and Sierra Leone. The structure of the learning visits will be comprised of 3 key components: 
i)	Field visits to project communities
ii)	Understanding resilience programming and the benefits to the communities
iii)	Information exchange, sharing and use between the Ethiopia and Sierra Leone /Liberia programs teams and partners</narrative>
  </description>
